# CRLF must be preserved byte-for-byte in these files: cmd.exe treats a stray
# LF as command corruption (e.g. inside a here-doc-style PowerShell block), so
# git must never normalize or diff-convert line endings here. `-text` tells
# git to leave line endings alone and skip text-diff normalization entirely.
* -text
*.bat -text
*.cmd -text
*.xml -text
